==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~6 seconds<sup>2f~180f</sup>.
*20 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*4 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 0.33~0.67 seconds<sup>10f~20f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Type 10 (Hometown Self-Defense Force)|Type 10s]] spawn, delay 2~40 seconds<sup>60f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't too difficult. Bring any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]] to make this stage much easier.

